  "hotel_name": "【2026シルバーウィーク】秋の始まりに行きたい！紅葉×温泉の絶景旅館6選｜露天風呂から楽しむ初秋の名湯めぐり",
  "description": "2026年シルバーウィークは紅葉シーズンの幕開け。露天風呂から色づく渓谷美を楽しめる絶景温泉旅館を楽天トラベルから厳選。奥飛騨・蔦温泉・上高地など。",
  "is_special_feature": true,
  "review": "<h2 id=\"intro\">【2026シルバーウィーク】秋の始まりに行きたい！紅葉×温泉の絶景旅館6選｜露天風呂から楽しむ初秋の名湯めぐり</h2>\n<p>シルバーウィーク（9/19〜23）は、山間部を中心に<strong>紅葉が色づき始める絶好のタイミング</strong>です。露天風呂から眺める赤・黄・橙の紅葉グラデーションは、この時期だけの贅沢。</p>\n<p>標高1,000m以上の高地温泉や東北の名湯では、9月下旬には早くも見頃を迎えます。楽天トラベルから<strong>秋の絶景×温泉が同時に楽しめる旅館</strong>を厳選しました。</p>\n<div class=\"my-6 p-5 bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl shadow-sm\">\n  <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-gray-200 pb-2 mb-3\">📌 目次</h3>\n  <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-stone-700 font-medium\">\n    <li><a href=\"#kouyou\" class=\"hover:underline\">1. 🍁 9月下旬に紅葉が楽しめるエリアMAP</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"#ranking\" class=\"hover:underline\">2. 🏨 紅葉×温泉の絶景旅館6選</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n<hr class=\"my-8 border-gray-200\" />\n<h2 id=\"kouyou\">🍁 1. 9月下旬に紅葉が始まるエリア</h2>\n<div class=\"overflow-x-auto my-6\"><table class=\"w-full text-xs text-left border-collapse border border-gray-200\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-800 text-white font-bold\"><th class=\"p-3 border border-gray-200\">エリア</th><th class=\"p-3 border border-gray-200\">紅葉の見頃</th><th class=\"p-3 border border-gray-200\">温泉の特徴</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"text-gray-800 font-medium\">\n<tr class=\"bg-white hover:bg-amber-50\"><td class=\"p-3 border font-bold\">奥飛騨・平湯温泉（岐阜）</td><td class=\"p-3 border\">9月下旬〜10月中旬</td><td class=\"p-3 border\">標高1,200m。北アルプスの紅葉と野趣あふれる露天風呂</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"bg-amber-50/30 hover:bg-amber-50\"><td class=\"p-3 border font-bold\">蔦温泉（青森・十和田）</td><td class=\"p-3 border\">9月下旬〜10月中旬</td><td class=\"p-3 border\">蔦沼の紅葉は「朝焼けの絶景」として全国的に有名</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"bg-white hover:bg-amber-50\"><td class=\"p-3 border font-bold\">上高地・中の湯（長野）</td><td class=\"p-3 border\">9月下旬〜10月上旬</td><td class=\"p-3 border\">穂高連峰×カラマツの黄金色。標高1,500m超の絶景温泉</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"bg-amber-50/30 hover:bg-amber-50\"><td class=\"p-3 border font-bold\">二岐温泉（福島・天栄村）</td><td class=\"p-3 border\">10月上旬〜中旬</td><td class=\"p-3 border\">渓谷沿いの秘湯。ブナの原生林が色づく絶景</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<hr class=\"my-8 border-gray-200\" />\n<h2 id=\"ranking\">🏨 おすすめ宿・ホテル一覧</h2>\n<p>楽天トラベルから厳選した実在施設をご紹介します。全国の名湯・名宿の中から、テーマに合った高評価の宿をピックアップしました。</p>\n\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-red-500/10 via-orange-500/10 to-amber-500/10 border border-red-400/40 shadow-sm space-y-4\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-gray-300/40 pb-3\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"text-xs font-black text-red-900 bg-red-200 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">🍁 おすすめ 第1位</span>\n      <span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-red-900 bg-white border border-gray-300/60 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full\">岐阜県</span>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-red-800\">⭐ 4.09 / 5.0</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4\">\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-1/3\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/54007/54007.jpg\" alt=\"奥飛騨　平湯温泉　岡田旅館\" class=\"w-full h-auto rounded-xl shadow-md border border-red-200\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-2/3 space-y-2\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-black font-journal-serif text-red-950\">奥飛騨　平湯温泉　岡田旅館</h3>\n      <p class=\"text-xs text-red-950/80 leading-relaxed font-medium\">全て掛け流しの温泉旅館。貸切＆露天風呂付客室の温もり感じるおもてなしの湯宿。</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"pt-4 text-right\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F54007%2F54007.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-red-600 to-orange-600 hover:from-red-500 hover:to-orange-500 text-white font-extrabold text-xs rounded-xl shadow transition\">\n      🍁 秋の空室・プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-red-500/10 via-orange-500/10 to-amber-500/10 border border-red-400/40 shadow-sm space-y-4\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-gray-300/40 pb-3\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"text-xs font-black text-red-900 bg-red-200 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">🍁 おすすめ 第2位</span>\n      <span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-red-900 bg-white border border-gray-300/60 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full\">青森県</span>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-red-800\">⭐ 4.65 / 5.0</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4\">\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-1/3\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/142919/142919.jpg\" alt=\"蔦温泉旅館－足元から源泉湧出の自噴温泉－\" class=\"w-full h-auto rounded-xl shadow-md border border-red-200\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-2/3 space-y-2\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-black font-journal-serif text-red-950\">蔦温泉旅館－足元から源泉湧出の自噴温泉－</h3>\n      <p class=\"text-xs text-red-950/80 leading-relaxed font-medium\">約千年前から源泉のやさしい湯が湧き出てくる全国でも希少な「源泉湧き流し」の湯をお楽しみ下さい</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"pt-4 text-right\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F142919%2F142919.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-red-600 to-orange-600 hover:from-red-500 hover:to-orange-500 text-white font-extrabold text-xs rounded-xl shadow transition\">\n      🍁 秋の空室・プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-red-500/10 via-orange-500/10 to-amber-500/10 border border-red-400/40 shadow-sm space-y-4\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-gray-300/40 pb-3\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"text-xs font-black text-red-900 bg-red-200 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">🍁 おすすめ 第3位</span>\n      <span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-red-900 bg-white border border-gray-300/60 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full\">長野県</span>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-red-800\">⭐ 4.47 / 5.0</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4\">\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-1/3\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/106180/106180.jpg\" alt=\"中の湯温泉旅館\" class=\"w-full h-auto rounded-xl shadow-md border border-red-200\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-2/3 space-y-2\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-black font-journal-serif text-red-950\">中の湯温泉旅館</h3>\n      <p class=\"text-xs text-red-950/80 leading-relaxed font-medium\">眼前に雄大なアルプスの山々が眺められ、原生林に囲まれたとても静かな所で、上高地の散策や焼岳登山に便利</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"pt-4 text-right\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F106180%2F106180.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-red-600 to-orange-600 hover:from-red-500 hover:to-orange-500 text-white font-extrabold text-xs rounded-xl shadow transition\">\n      🍁 秋の空室・プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-red-500/10 via-orange-500/10 to-amber-500/10 border border-red-400/40 shadow-sm space-y-4\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-gray-300/40 pb-3\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"text-xs font-black text-red-900 bg-red-200 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">🍁 おすすめ 第4位</span>\n      <span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-red-900 bg-white border border-gray-300/60 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full\">福島県</span>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-red-800\">⭐ 4.59 / 5.0</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4\">\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-1/3\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/106182/106182.jpg\" alt=\"二岐温泉　柏屋旅館\" class=\"w-full h-auto rounded-xl shadow-md border border-red-200\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-2/3 space-y-2\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-black font-journal-serif text-red-950\">二岐温泉　柏屋旅館</h3>\n      <p class=\"text-xs text-red-950/80 leading-relaxed font-medium\">＜体の芯まで温まる秘湯＞5つの源泉を持つ100％掛け流し♪一押し「自噴巌風呂」は無料貸切</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"pt-4 text-right\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F106182%2F106182.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-red-600 to-orange-600 hover:from-red-500 hover:to-orange-500 text-white font-extrabold text-xs rounded-xl shadow transition\">\n      🍁 秋の空室・プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-red-500/10 via-orange-500/10 to-amber-500/10 border border-red-400/40 shadow-sm space-y-4\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-gray-300/40 pb-3\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"text-xs font-black text-red-900 bg-red-200 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">🍁 おすすめ 第5位</span>\n      <span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-red-900 bg-white border border-gray-300/60 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full\">熊本県</span>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-red-800\">⭐ 4.52 / 5.0</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4\">\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-1/3\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/16280/16280.jpg\" alt=\"国登録有形文化財の宿　人吉温泉　芳野旅館\" class=\"w-full h-auto rounded-xl shadow-md border border-red-200\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-2/3 space-y-2\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-black font-journal-serif text-red-950\">国登録有形文化財の宿　人吉温泉　芳野旅館</h3>\n      <p class=\"text-xs text-red-950/80 leading-relaxed font-medium\">【国登録有形文化財の宿】歴史感じる純和風旅館　源泉掛け流し天然温泉と旬の会席料理で心和むひと時を</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"pt-4 te